                        ],
                        "form": "коллизио́нна"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "f93d396b-e46e-4d6f-a6c2-a1e2e2c46af7",
                        "entry_id": "b6594537-cf64-3eba-8819-ba0b20400c99",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "short-form"
                        ],
                        "form": "коллизио́нны"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "38a3dc86-82da-31c0-b66d-47eb59ad7510",
                        "entry_id": "b6594537-cf64-3eba-8819-ba0b20400c99",
                        "glosses": [
                            "юр. определяющий, какой из двух сталкивающихся правовых актов должен быть применён в том или другом случае правовых коллизий."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "4326081e-18e2-4285-a70a-84b9930cd86a",
                                "sense_id": "38a3dc86-82da-31c0-b66d-47eb59ad7510",
                                "text": "Таким образом, вопрос о применении коллизионных норм частноправовых отношений в современных условиях становится наиболее актуальным."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f407a2aa-b5ce-31fa-8973-020275afcdab",
                        "entry_id": "b6594537-cf64-3eba-8819-ba0b20400c99",
                        "glosses": [
                            "геол. характерный для коллизии — линии соприкосновения, столкновения различных тектонических плит; либо имеющий к коллизии иное непосредственное отношение."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "4183d4f7-802e-40be-ac59-ad82299235e8",
                                "sense_id": "f407a2aa-b5ce-31fa-8973-020275afcdab",
                                "text": "Кинематика коллизионного взаимодействия Беломорского и Карельского микроконтинентов в пределах Кукасозерского сегмента и Северо-Карельского пояса."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ce0a6318-e43c-3dfe-8c19-877245be9800",
                        "entry_id": "b6594537-cf64-3eba-8819-ba0b20400c99",
                        "glosses": [
                            "спец. в сетевых технологиях: использующий общую среду передачи."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c5e0c788-0ae3-4a70-aa76-798e7c67f55b",
                                "sense_id": "ce0a6318-e43c-3dfe-8c19-877245be9800",
                                "text": "Стрессовое тестирование помогло выявить дефектные сетевые карты, мешающие работе всего коллизионного домена."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "aa7b26ec-31a4-4bc9-91eb-9e15475dd1b0",
                        "source_entry_id": "b6594537-cf64-3eba-8819-ba0b20400c99",
                        "source_sense_description": "юр.",
                        "target_lang_word": "conflict",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "conflict",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "05f40121-b302-3786-bd21-47fbb9a8784d",
                                        "entry_id": "7f7811ba-4c83-3ff1-94f7-32f60f90bcec",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A clash or disagreement, often violent, between two or more opposing groups or individuals."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a4b5c197-fa6b-470d-8515-92acd36d6668",
                                                "sense_id": "05f40121-b302-3786-bd21-47fbb9a8784d",
                                                "text": "The conflict between the government and the rebels began three years ago."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f28ef04d-d76d-4ef3-9691-4ab065434544",
                                                "sense_id": "05f40121-b302-3786-bd21-47fbb9a8784d",
                                                "text": "One particularly damaging, but often ignored, effect of conflict on education is the proliferation of attacks on schools[…]as children, teachers or school buildings become the targets of attacks. Parents fear sending their children to school. Girls are particularly vulnerable to sexual violence."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c528d018-9ed5-32fa-8915-4c7f623c4d78",
                                        "entry_id": "7f7811ba-4c83-3ff1-94f7-32f60f90bcec",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An incompatibility, as of two things that cannot be simultaneously fulfilled."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9f554f17-ffd2-4d0c-9ad1-a80dd85a1568",
                                                "sense_id": "c528d018-9ed5-32fa-8915-4c7f623c4d78",
                                                "text": "I wanted to attend the meeting but there's a conflict in my schedule that day."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "conflict",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2af6dccd-45ff-3668-8df7-be909b22479c",
                                        "entry_id": "6ca08eca-3d10-3182-9d35-7e457f844c31",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To be at odds (with); to disagree or be incompatible"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2212ce62-2801-43dd-9137-e80d570f1e89",
                                                "sense_id": "2af6dccd-45ff-3668-8df7-be909b22479c",
                                                "text": "[T. E.] Lawrence said that in the end he felt himself to be fighting not for the imperial British but for the rebellious Arabs. All too often he conflicted with British bureaucratic fustiness."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cb745ba1-e193-34f2-a7f8-e8aa48046a48",
                                        "entry_id": "6ca08eca-3d10-3182-9d35-7e457f844c31",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To overlap (with), as in a schedule."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0b1f0084-d536-4595-a00a-462d9a0ec36e",
                                                "sense_id": "cb745ba1-e193-34f2-a7f8-e8aa48046a48",
                                                "text": "Your conference call conflicts with my older one: please reschedule."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c193d07f-8504-4943-a0ef-430e6d4edf00",
                                                "sense_id": "cb745ba1-e193-34f2-a7f8-e8aa48046a48",
                                                "text": "It appears that our schedules conflict."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9ef988ce-9b91-4bab-9149-45d16893e79e",
                        "source_entry_id": "b6594537-cf64-3eba-8819-ba0b20400c99",
